<!doctype html><html lang="ko"><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>스팀 리뷰 분석</title><style>*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:#f5f5ef;color:#1d302e;font:16px/1.65 "Malgun Gothic",sans-serif}main{max-width:1000px;margin:auto;padding:38px 5vw}h1{font-size:clamp(30px,5vw,52px);margin:0}header{border-bottom:2px solid #1d302e;padding-bottom:20px}select,button{font:inherit;padding:7px 12px;border-radius:6px;border:1px solid #adb9ad;background:white;color:inherit;cursor:pointer}label{display:inline-block;margin:12px 12px 0 0}section{background:white;padding:20px;margin:16px 0;border-radius:10px}button{margin:3px}button.active{background:#21584b;color:white}details{padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd}summary{cursor:pointer}p{overflow-wrap:anywhere;white-space:pre-wrap}small{color:#51645e}</style><main><header><h1>스팀 리뷰 분석</h1><p>게임별 장단점과 그 근거가 된 리뷰를 확인하세요.</p><label>게임 <select id="game"></select></label><label>카테고리 <select id="category"></select></label></header><p id="counts"></p><section><h2>장점 키워드</h2><div id="pos"></div></section><section><h2>단점 키워드</h2><div id="neg"></div></section><section><h2 id="title">근거 리뷰</h2><div id="quotes"></div><button id="more" hidden>더 보기</button></section><small>숫자는 해당 표현을 포함한 서로 다른 리뷰 수입니다. 주제와 긍정·부정은 AI 예측입니다.</small></main><script>const D=/*DATA*/;const el=id=>document.getElementById(id);function options(id,vs){for(const v of vs)el(id).add(new Option(v,v))}options('game',[...new Set(D.games)]);options('category',D.labels.filter((_,i)=>i%2===0).map(x=>x.slice(0,-3)));let entries=[],offset=0;function show(){for(const [i,s] of entries.slice(offset,offset+15)){const d=document.createElement('details'),a=document.createElement('summary'),p=document.createElement('p');a.textContent=s;p.textContent=D.reviews[i];d.append(a,p);el('quotes').append(d)}offset+=15;el('more').hidden=offset>=entries.length}el('more').onclick=show;function refresh(){const g=el('game').value,c=el('category').value;el('counts').textContent='분석 대상 리뷰 '+D.games.filter(x=>x===g).length.toLocaleString()+'개';el('quotes').replaceChildren();el('title').textContent='키워드를 선택하면 근거 리뷰가 표시됩니다';el('more').hidden=true;for(const [k,pol] of [['pos','긍정'],['neg','부정']]){const root=el(k);root.replaceChildren();const m=new Map();for(const [i,s,j,keys] of D.evidence){if(D.games[i]!==g||D.labels[j]!==c+'·'+pol)continue;for(const key of keys){if(!m.has(key))m.set(key,new Map());m.get(key).set(i,s)}}for(const [key,items] of [...m].sort((a,b)=>(a[0]==='그 외 표현')-(b[0]==='그 외 표현')||b[1].size-a[1].size).slice(0,5)){const b=document.createElement('button');b.textContent=key+' · '+items.size;b.onclick=()=>{document.querySelectorAll('button.active').forEach(x=>x.classList.remove('active'));b.classList.add('active');el('title').textContent=key+' · '+pol+' 근거 리뷰 '+items.size+'개';entries=[...items];offset=0;el('quotes').replaceChildren();show()};root.append(b)}if(!m.size)root.textContent='이 조건에서 예측된 의견이 없습니다.'}}el('game').onchange=el('category').onchange=refresh;refresh();</script></html>
